        "context": "[Ecdf00123e1bf105831e21391] [Bugfix] SharedStorage Connector for V1 PD multimodal > Purpose\nIt brings in the mm_hashes from the Request to the connector to form a proper key; that can help distinguish kv for different mm input. It fix the problems about wrongly reusing the kv mentioned in the issue.\nSupport multiple multimodal inputs as well.\n\n[Ea1f3bc74a28885b37223b8a1] [Bug]: Wrongly reuse KV, for V1 PD disaggregation with multimodal input > Before submitting a new issue...\nCan you check if #21611 fixes this issue?\n\n[E544dde29cf71b2f4a4f41b8e] 6. KV Cache 深度解析 > 6.3 KV Cache 的数据结构\n```python\nattn_output = attention(new_q, kv_cache[layer_i]['key'], kv_cache[layer_i]['value'])\n```\n\n[E950ae30c05e23500e7ac279b] Parallelism and Scaling > Distributed inference strategies for a single-model replica\n```text\nINFO 07-23 13:56:04 [kv_cache_utils.py:775] GPU KV cache size: 643,232 tokens\nINFO 07-23 13:56:04 [kv_cache_utils.py:779] Maximum concurrency for 40,960 tokens per request: 15.70x\n```\n\n[E66963e616c94bfb4a30bf988] Disaggregated Prefilling (experimental) > Development\n- **Connector**: Connector allows **kv consumer** to retrieve the KV caches of a batch of request from **kv producer**.\n- **LookupBuffer**: LookupBuffer provides two API: `insert` KV cache and `drop_select` KV cache.\nThe semantics of `insert` and `drop_select` are similar to SQL, where `insert` inserts a KV cache into the buffer, and `drop_select` returns the KV cache that matches the given condition and drop it from the buffer.\n\n[E4c748404f4762fbbc7e38975] 8. 显存规划详解 > 8.4 完整规划案例\n第二步，计算 KV Cache：\n- LLaMA-2-13B 配置：$L=40$, $h_{kv}=40$ (MHA), $d_k=128$\n- 单 token KV：$2 \\times 40 \\times 40 \\times 128 \\times 2 = 819{,}200$ Bytes = 800 KB\n- seq=4096, batch=8：$4096 \\times 800\\text{KB} \\times 8 = 25.6$ GB\n\n[E87010eed0c42f91ff36eb0a4] 8. 显存规划详解 > 8.3 推理态显存：权重 + KV Cache\n**（2）KV Cache**\n\n[E48a4ad9ec76f08f930f239ac] 2. 复用的物理基础：块级 KV 共享\n- KV Cache 以**固定大小的块**存储，请求通过块表间接引用物理块。\n- 只要两个请求的某些前缀块内容相同，就让它们的块表**指向同一个物理块**，配合**引用计数**记录有几个请求在用。\n- 一旦某请求在共享块之后要写入不同内容，Copy-on-Write 保证互不干扰。",
